<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="cyc-page sc-page">
{# Sector Cycle Intelligence — data-driven cycle map for the 11 US sector ETFs.
   A sibling of Cycle Intelligence (cycle.html): it REUSES that page's design system
   (cycle.css) + the mm_charts.js SVG engine, but every line is the sector ETF's REAL
   price (rebased / log) with a one-click "cycle position" oscillator toggle, and the
   turns / phase / projection are derived from the tape by engine/sector_cycles.py.
   Data + narratives are emitted by scripts/build_sector_cycles.py as
   sector_cycles_data.js; this template owns only the page shell + shared nav. #}
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t||'dark');var l=localStorage.getItem('lang')||(function(){try{var L=navigator.languages||[navigator.language||navigator.userLanguage||''],i;for(i=0;i<L.length;i++)if((L[i]||'').toLowerCase().slice(0,2)==='zh')return'zh';if(/Shanghai|Hong_Kong|Macau|Urumqi|Chongqing|Harbin|Kashgar|Chungking/.test(Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone||''))return'zh';}catch(e){}return'';})();if(l)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-lang',l);}catch(e){}</script>
<title>Sector Cycle Intelligence — Mastermind</title>
{% set seo_title = "US Sector Cycles — Mastermind" %}{% set seo_desc = "Every US sector placed on its cycle clock — who is early, who is late, and where leadership is rotating next. Updated nightly from price, breadth and flows." %}{% set seo_path = "sector_cycles.html" %}
{% include "_seo_head.html.j2" %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="cycle.css?v=4">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="sector_cycles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="sector_cycles_platform.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="sector_cycles_states.css">
{# Preload the critical path (core data + engine + orchestrator) so they download in PARALLEL;
   prefetch the after-first-paint chunks. optimize_assets stamps ?v=<hash> on these hrefs post-render
   → immutable edge cache; sector_cycles.js vUrl() reuses the stamped/preloaded response. #}
<link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles_data.js" as="script">
<link rel="preload" href="mm_charts.js" as="script">
<link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles.js" as="script"><link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles_states.js" as="script"><link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles_face.js" as="script"><link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles_compare.js" as="script"><link rel="preload" href="sector_cycles_platform.js" as="script">
<link rel="prefetch" href="sector_cycles_series_data.js" as="script">
<link rel="prefetch" href="sector_cycles_narr_data.js" as="script">
<link rel="prefetch" href="sector_cycles_dna_data.js" as="script">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="macro-desk.css?v=e46e15d5">
</head>
<body class="macro-desk page-cycle">
{% include "_site_nav.html.j2" %}

<div class="cyc-wrap">
  <header class="cyc-hd">
    <div class="ht">
      <div class="cyc-kicker"><span class="hb"></span> <span class="l-en">Sector Cycle Intelligence</span><span class="l-zh">板块周期情报</span></div>
      <h1 class="cyc-title"><span class="l-en">Where every US sector stands</span><span class="l-zh">每个美股板块所处的位置</span></h1>
      <p class="cyc-sub"><span class="l-en">The 11 GICS sector ETFs on one cycle clock — real price (rebased &amp; log, so every
        line shares an axis) with a one-tap <b>cycle-position</b> view. Peaks &amp; troughs are auto-detected from the tape,
        each sector is graded by where it sits in its cycle, and clicking a leg tells you what drove the move.
        Projections here are windows, not certainties — re-drawn nightly as new data lands.</span><span class="l-zh">11 个 GICS 板块 ETF 同处一张周期时钟——真实价格（再基准化并取对数，使每条线共用同一坐标轴），并可一键切换为<b>周期位置</b>视图。波峰与波谷由价格走势自动识别，每个板块按其周期所处阶段评级，点击任一区段即可了解推动该走势的原因。这里的预测是时间窗口，而非确定性结论——每晚随新数据重新计算。</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyc-ctrls">
      <span class="cyc-asof"><span class="l-en">As of</span><span class="l-zh">截至</span> <span id="sc-asof">{% if cycles_ctx is defined and cycles_ctx.asof %}{{ cycles_ctx.asof|e }}{% else %}…{% endif %}</span>{% if cycles_ctx is defined and cycles_ctx.generation %}{% set g = cycles_ctx.generation %} · <span class="sc-gen" data-gen="{{ g.status|e }}"><span class="l-en">Generation</span><span class="l-zh">生成状态</span> {% if g.status == 'aligned' %}<span class="l-en">Up to date</span><span class="l-zh">已是最新</span>{% elif g.status == 'incompatible_generation' %}<span class="l-en" title="History {{ (g.artifact_session or '—')|e }}, current read {{ (g.consumer_session or '—')|e }}. Not drawn, so the two are never mixed.">History is from a different day</span><span class="l-zh" title="历史 {{ (g.artifact_session or '—')|e }}，当前读数 {{ (g.consumer_session or '—')|e }}。不绘制，避免混用。">历史来自不同日期</span>{% else %}<span class="l-en">— unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">— 不可用</span>{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}</span> <a class="cyc-open-central" href="sector_central.html#cycles"><span class="l-en">Open in Sector Central</span><span class="l-zh">在板块中枢查看</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  {% with lock_renderer='sector_cycles.js', lock_fill='sc-cards',
    lock_hide='#sc-tabs,.cyc-stage,.cyc-cards-hd,#sc-cards,.cyc-asof',
    lock_en='Members get each sector fund on the cycle clock, '
    ~ 'its scorecard, and what drove each leg of the move.',
    lock_zh='会员可查看每只板块 ETF 的周期时钟、记分卡，以及每一段走势背后的原因。' %}
  {% include "_cycle_locked_slot.html.j2" %}
  {% endwith %}

  <div class="sc-tabs" id="sc-tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="sc-tab on" data-fam="sectors" role="tab">🧭 <span class="l-en">Sector ETFs</span><span class="l-zh">板块 ETF</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-sec"></i></button>
    <button class="sc-tab" data-fam="baskets" role="tab">🧺 <span class="l-en">Thematic Baskets</span><span class="l-zh">主题篮子</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-bsk"></i></button>
    <button class="sc-tab" data-fam="nasdaq" role="tab">💻 <span class="l-en">Nasdaq-100</span><span class="l-zh">纳斯达克100</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-ndx"></i></button>
    <button class="sc-tab" data-fam="russell" role="tab">🔭 <span class="l-en">Russell-2000</span><span class="l-zh">罗素2000</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-rut"></i></button>
  </div>

  <section class="cyc-stage">
    <div class="cyc-hero">
      <div class="cyc-hero-hd">
        <h2 id="sc-hero-title"><span class="l-en">Sector rotation overlay</span><span class="l-zh">板块轮动叠加</span></h2>
        <div class="cyc-hero-tools">
          <div class="sc-modes" id="sc-modes" aria-label="Chart mode">
            <button class="sc-mbtn" data-mode="price" aria-pressed="false"><span class="l-en">Price</span><span class="l-zh">价格</span></button>
            <button class="sc-mbtn on" data-mode="osc" aria-pressed="true"><span class="l-en">Cycle position</span><span class="l-zh">周期位置</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-mode-cap"><span class="l-en">Low = washed-out · High = stretched</span><span class="l-zh">低 = 超卖 · 高 = 拉伸</span></div>
          <div class="sc-advanced" id="sc-advanced">
            <button type="button" class="sc-adv-toggle" id="sc-adv-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sc-advbody"><span class="l-en">Chart options</span><span class="l-zh">图表选项</span></button>
            <div class="sc-adv-body" id="sc-advbody">
              <div class="sc-scale disabled" id="sc-scale" hidden aria-label="Price scale">
                <button class="sc-sbtn on" data-scale="log" aria-pressed="true"><span class="l-en">Log</span><span class="l-zh">对数</span></button>
                <button class="sc-sbtn" data-scale="linear" aria-pressed="false"><span class="l-en">Linear</span><span class="l-zh">线性</span></button>
              </div>
              <div class="cyc-legend" id="sc-legend" aria-label="Legend">
                <span><i class="lc" style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--down) 42%,transparent)"></i> <span class="l-en">washed-out</span><span class="l-zh">超卖</span></span>
                <span><i class="lc" style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted) 32%,transparent)"></i> <span class="l-en">mid-cycle</span><span class="l-zh">中段</span></span>
                <span><i class="lc" style="background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 46%,transparent)"></i> <span class="l-en">stretched</span><span class="l-zh">拉伸</span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="cyc-zoom" id="sc-zoom" aria-label="Zoom"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cyc-groups" id="sc-groups" aria-label="Phase filter"></div>
      <div class="cyc-chips" id="sc-chips" aria-label="Sector toggles"></div>
      <div class="sc-baskets" id="sc-baskets" aria-label="Thematic baskets"></div>
      <span id="sc-sr-status" class="sc-sr-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
      <div class="sc-chartwrap">
        <div id="sc-chart" data-h="600" role="img" aria-label="Sector cycle clock — each line a sector's 0 to 100 cycle position over time. Tap a line for its story."></div>
        <div class="sc-chart-hint" id="sc-chart-hint" hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="cyc-detail" id="sc-detail">
      <div class="cyc-handle" id="sc-handle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cyc-panels">
        <div class="cyc-panel show" id="sc-panel-default"></div>
        <div class="cyc-panel" id="sc-panel-focus"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <div class="cyc-cards-hd">
    <h2><span class="l-en">Sector scorecards</span><span class="l-zh">板块记分卡</span></h2>
    <span class="sub"><span class="l-en">Tap any card — or its line on the chart — to focus it</span><span class="l-zh">点按任意卡片（或图中其曲线）以聚焦</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="cyc-cards" id="sc-cards"></div>
</div>

<script src="sector_cycles_data.js"></script>
<script src="mm_charts.js"></script>
<script src="sector_cycles_states.js"></script>
<script src="sector_cycles_face.js"></script>
<script src="sector_cycles_compare.js"></script>
<script src="sector_cycles_platform.js"></script>
<script>window.SC_EXTRA_DATA=['sector_cycles_narr_data.js','sector_cycles_dna_data.js'];window.SC_SERIES_DATA='sector_cycles_series_data.js';</script>
<script src="sector_cycles.js"></script>
<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){try{var a=(window.SECTOR_CYCLES&&window.SECTOR_CYCLES.meta||{}).asOf;var e=document.getElementById('sc-asof');if(!e)return;if(typeof a==='string'&&a){e.textContent=a;}else if(e.textContent==='…'){e.innerHTML='<span class="l-en">— unavailable</span><span class="l-zh">— 不可用</span>';}}catch(e){}});</script>
<script>
// window.SECTOR_CYCLES comes from a deferred script, which has run by DOMContentLoaded.
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
// basis other than tr prints nothing, since the sentence would then be wrong.
try {
  var meta = window.SECTOR_CYCLES && window.SECTOR_CYCLES.meta || {};
  var h = meta.rs_history;
  var asof = document.getElementById("sc-asof");
  if (asof && h && h.naturally_observed === false && h.basis === "tr") {
    var en = document.createElement("span");
    en.className = "l-en";
    en.textContent = "RS rank is rebuilt from total-return price history against "
      + h.benchmark + ", through " + h.as_of
      + ". It is not an observed record.";
    var zh = document.createElement("span");
    zh.className = "l-zh";
    zh.textContent = "相对强度排名由总回报价格历史重建，基准 "
      + h.benchmark + "，截至 " + h.as_of
      + "。并非当时观察到的记录。";
    asof.parentNode.appendChild(document.createElement("br"));
    asof.parentNode.appendChild(en);
    asof.parentNode.appendChild(zh);
  }
} catch(e) {}
});
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
